  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Traben-0/Entity_Texture_Features/master/.github/README-assets/icon.png\" width=\"150\"><br></p><h1>實體紋理功能 (ETF)</h1><hr><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252frURmwrzUcz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vU8pcbf.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yZzzW4Q.pngg\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rpoyjVG.png\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VgKekoJ.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7fioiRx.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tiNmDIH.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Texture_Features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EYNx6oL.png\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yar5K6v.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ftraben\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xdhWKwC.png\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p><hr><h1>關於</h1><p>ETF 是一款支援 Fabric、Forge 與 NeoForge 的模組，新增了多項<em>實體紋理功能</em>，包括實體與玩家外觀功能！</p><p>ETF 主要支援 OptiFine 格式，可視為 OptiFine 的替代模組之一，但具備更多功能與選項！</p><p>如果您想在 Fabric 上獲得更多 OptiFine 功能，可以查看 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flambdaurora.dev%252foptifine_alternatives\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這份清單</a>（由 LambdaAurora 製作），<strong>或者</strong>使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmodpack%252ffabulously-optimized\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabulously Optimized 模組包</a>，其中包含了<strong>所有</strong> OptiFine 相容模組！</p><h1>功能</h1><ul>\n<li>透過 OptiFine 格式支援自訂與隨機實體紋理，甚至包含更多屬性！ <a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Texture_Features/blob/master/.github/README-assets/RANDOM_GUIDE.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[指南]</a></li>\n<li>支援 OptiFine 格式的發光/發亮實體紋理，<a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Texture_Features/blob/master/.github/README-assets/EMISSIVE_GUIDE.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[指南]</a></li>\n<li>生物眨眼的簡易格式。<a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Texture_Features/blob/master/.github/README.md#-blinking-textures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[指南]</a></li>\n<li>玩家外觀功能，包括眨眼、發光紋理等更多功能！ <a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Texture_Features/blob/master/.github/README-assets/SKIN_GUIDE.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[指南]</a></li>\n</ul><h1>相容於</h1><ul>\n<li>OptiFine 的隨機/自訂或發光實體資源包</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">實體模型功能 (EMF)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcem\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">dorianpb 的舊版 CEM 模組</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsodium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252firis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iris Shaders</a>（支援程度因光影包而異）</li>\n<li>模組新增的實體（僅限模組創作者使用原版渲染程式碼來渲染其生物時）</li>\n<li>以及其他更多</li>\n</ul><h1>設定與配置</h1><p>您可以在遊戲中透過 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a>、資源包畫面中的設定按鈕，或直接編輯位於 <code>config/entity_texture_features.json</code> 的設定檔來更改設定。</p><h1>模組支援</h1><p>只要模組新增的實體使用常規的原版渲染方式，此模組應能與之相容。</p><p>任何在自訂 GUI 中顯示實體的模組，可以透過將 <code>entity.getblockstate</code> 設定為 <code>null</code> 或 <code>VOID_AIR</code> 類型來強制使用預設紋理；同樣的效果可透過將顯示生物的 UUID 設定為 <code>UUID.nameUUIDFromBytes((\"GENERIC\").getBytes())</code> 來達成。</p><hr><h1>更新日誌</h1><p>您可以在<a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Texture_Features/blob/master/common/CHANGELOG.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>找到更新日誌。</p><hr><h1>需要協助或有疑問嗎？</h1><p>您可以透過我的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252frURmwrzUcz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>（<em>首選</em>）或是在 <a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Texture_Features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 上開啟問題來聯絡我。</p><hr><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252frURmwrzUcz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vU8pcbf.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yZzzW4Q.pngg\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rpoyjVG.png\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VgKekoJ.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7fioiRx.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tiNmDIH.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Texture_Features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EYNx6oL.png\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yar5K6v.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ftraben\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xdhWKwC.png\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p><hr><h2>主機合作夥伴方案</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d641\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BVzZfTc1/images/bfb592538f8206a6a2d72d19c90714bea91b0e07.png\" alt=\"圖片\"></a></p>",
